{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026FbUIliD5Cl1793264833.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>行政長官李家超下午公開宏福苑大火獨立委員會報告，及交代跟進工作，他率領相關官員鞠躬道歉。</p><p></p><p>行政長官李家超說：「對宏福苑火災發生，導致168人死亡，包括一位英勇救火殉職的消防員，1,984個家庭受影響，帶給災民悲痛、社會哀傷。我作為行政長官、政府之首，深感難過，我代表特區政府，向災民及廣大市民表示道歉。」</p><p></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1203503-%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E5%A0%B1%E5%91%8A%E5%85%A8%E9%9D%A2%E6%94%B9%E9%9D%A9%E6%88%BF%E5%B1%8B%E5%B1%80%E5%85%A7%E9%83%A8%E9%87%8D%E7%B5%84%E8%A8%AD%E5%85%AC%E7%87%9F%E6%88%BF%E5%B1%8B%E6%A8%93%E5%AE%87%E7%AE%A1%E5%88%B6%E7%B5%84%E4%B8%80%E6%96%87%E7%9C%8B%E6%B8%85\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">宏福苑報告‧全面改革｜房屋局內部重組　設公營房屋樓宇管制組｜一文看清</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1203507-%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E5%A0%B1%E5%91%8A%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E6%8E%A8%E5%85%A8%E9%9D%A2%E6%94%B9%E9%9D%A9%E8%A8%AD%E7%9D%A3%E5%B0%8E%E5%A7%94%E5%93%A1%E6%9C%83%E5%8F%8A%E4%B8%AD%E5%A4%AE%E6%95%B8%E6%93%9A%E7%B3%BB%E7%B5%B1%E4%B8%80%E6%96%87%E7%9C%8B%E6%B8%85\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">宏福苑報告｜政府推全面改革　設督導委員會及中央數據系統｜一文看清</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1203506-%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E5%A0%B1%E5%91%8A%E6%94%B9%E9%9D%A9%E6%A8%93%E5%AE%87%E7%B6%AD%E4%BF%AE%E7%9B%A3%E7%AE%A1%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%E7%BD%B0%E5%89%87%E6%89%93%E6%93%8A%E5%9C%8D%E6%A8%99%E5%85%A8%E9%9D%A2%E6%94%B9%E9%9D%A9%E4%B8%80%E6%96%87%E7%9C%8B%E6%B8%85\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">宏福苑報告｜改革樓宇維修監管　提升罰則打擊圍標｜全面改革‧一文看清</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1203513-%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E5%A0%B1%E5%91%8A%E5%85%A8%E9%9D%A2%E6%94%B9%E9%9D%A9%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E6%93%B23%E5%84%84%E8%A8%AD%E6%A8%93%E5%AE%87%E7%B6%AD%E4%BF%AE%E5%B1%80%E6%8E%A5%E7%AE%A1%E5%B8%82%E5%BB%BA%E5%B1%80%E6%9C%8D%E5%8B%99%E4%B8%80%E6%96%87%E7%9C%8B%E6%B8%85\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">宏福苑報告‧全面改革｜政府擲3億設樓宇維修局　